    "media:imagetext": "PHILiPPINE AIR LInES\nEffective Apr. 1, 1952\nto July 31, 1952\nPAL\nspanning 3 of the world\nALL YEAR FARES\nOFF SEASON FARES\nP.A.L. OFFICES\nPHE 290\nCombination Air/Sea Trips\nPAL passengers may now enjoy both the speed of air travel\nand the fascination of life aboard ship on trans-Pacific trips.\nBy agreement with American President Lines, tickets for a\ncombination air/sea voyage may be purchased at fares\nequal to one-half the applicable round trip fares between\nthe point of embarkation and point of debarkation on each\ncarrier.\nGo and Return on a One-Way Ticket\nAsk your Travel Agent for information about Round-the-\nWorld Trips via P.A.L. and connecting carriers. This year,\nplan a World Vacation.\n22\nTHE 24-HOUR CLOCK 21-9\nAM -inner circle\nPM - outer circle\nPrepared by Walther-Boland Associates • Printed in U.S.A.\n2005.132.091.003",
