    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "PHILIPPinE AIR LInES\nEffective Apr. 1, 1952\nto July 31, 1952\nPAL\nROUTE OF THE\nOrient Star\nP.A.L. SERVICE\nINTERNATIONAL SCHEDULES\nPASSENGER INFORMATION\nPHILIPPInE AIR LInES\nDC-6 Sleeper Service\nTrans-Pacific\nAsia\nEurope\nU.S.A.\nORIENT\nГВаРІТИВІЯ\nEUROPE\nCopr. 1952, Philippine Air Lines",
      "PHILiPPINE AIR LInES\nEffective Apr. 1, 1952\nto July 31, 1952\nPAL\nspanning 3 of the world\nALL YEAR FARES\nOFF SEASON FARES\nP.A.L. OFFICES\nPHE 290\nCombination Air/Sea Trips\nPAL passengers may now enjoy both the speed of air travel\nand the fascination of life aboard ship on trans-Pacific trips.\nBy agreement with American President Lines, tickets for a\ncombination air/sea voyage may be purchased at fares\nequal to one-half the applicable round trip fares between\nthe point of embarkation and point of debarkation on each\ncarrier.\nGo and Return on a One-Way Ticket\nAsk your Travel Agent for information about Round-the-\nWorld Trips via P.A.L. and connecting carriers. This year,\nplan a World Vacation.\n22\nTHE 24-HOUR CLOCK 21-9\nAM -inner circle\nPM - outer circle\nPrepared by Walther-Boland Associates • Printed in U.S.A.\n2005.132.091.003",
      "World Travelers\nchoose\nPHILIPPInE AIR LInES\nBATAAN\nfor:\n* Proved Dependability\nof its luxurious Douglas DC-6's and skilled, experienced\nflight crews. Known and respected throughout the world,\nthe famed four-engined DC-6 has earned an unequaled\nreputation for comfort and dependability in air travel.\nP.A.L.'s experienced flight crews, personalized service\nand trained cabin attendants are your assurance of a\nperfect trip.\n*\nUnexcelled Service\nprovided by courteous, competent pursers and cabin\nattendants. Excellent hot meals, refreshing between-meal\nsnacks and the sincere desire to make your flight a thor-\noughly enjoyable experience explain why world travelers\nacclaim the friendly, personalized service of Philippine\nAir Lines.\n* Real Comfort\nof the DC-6 pressurized, air-conditioned cabin —its adjust-\nable reclining chairs, full-size sleeping berths and con-\nvenient lounges. Smooth, \"above-weather\" fight along\nP.A.L's sunny route is your assurance of comfortable\ntravel in any season.\n* Fast, Reliable Schedules\nmade possible by dependable 300-mile-per-hour DC-6's\nand P.A.L.'s direct routes around 2/3 of the world. On-\ntime departures and arrivals and minimum stopovers have\nmade the Route of the Orient Star one of the world's\nfastest and most reliable.\nP. A.L. SERVICE\nINTERNATIONAL SCHEDULES\nPASSENGER INFORMATION"
    ],
